    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 4 — Tikkun Sight.</strong> 1/Soma Break, treat one of your misfires as if it had landed at base tier, and convert the Surge it would have spent into Clarity instead. Where others see a shattered angle, you see the angle that <em>was</em> there.</p>\n<p style=\"opacity:0.7;font-size:0.85em\">Click this feature on the sheet to mark the ability spent and post the chat card. Reset on Soma Break via the dialog's Reset button.</p>\n<p style=\"opacity:0.7;font-size:0.85em\">Nonviolent-scene rider: a Tikkun Sight conversion in a nonviolent scene also wipes the Corruption tick the gather would have caused.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"wlT4\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Tikkun Sight</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Reaction (after misfire) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Treat one of your misfires as if it landed at base tier; convert the Surge it would have spent into Clarity. In a nonviolent scene, also wipes the Corruption tick the gather would have caused.</div>\n</div>",
